/*********************************************
 * OPL Data - Weekly Elective (Mon-Fri) TEST
 * - D = {1..5} represents Mon..Fri (elective only)
 * - Avail[s][d] includes OFF days (e.g., off after night shift)
 * - Skills are constant across days; Avail controls working days
 *
 * SurgeryTypes mapping (1..10):
 * 1 Adeno, 2 Micro, 3 Buccal, 4 Excision, 5 Septo,
 * 6 Modified, 7 Thyroi, 8 Rhino, 9 Endos, 10 Sleep
 *********************************************/

